<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment falls to 12.5 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment falls to 12.5 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Employment Minister Miet Smet released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   May	 April	 May 1996</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 448,352   453,630     472,297</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 12.5	12.9	  13.0</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
